{"kind":"assert","text":"Addition to step E3 (request `17e075b3`), from the ES-1 ruling\n`bb2f7f17`, with one correction of my own text.\n\nThe first screen page that explores under the member's standing is\na local instance, and that is step E3. Step E2 is the MCP tool in\nthe agent host, and the MCP server opts in already. So E3, not E2,\nopens the application gateway for `standing` on a POST to\n`sessions`:\n- `packages/client/src/application-gateway.ts` admits exactly\n  `?standing=1` on that route, and no other query.\n- One case for the admitted form and one for each refused form.\n- A row for the sandbox in `docs/security/entry-points.md`.\n\nI wrote \"step E2\" in `bb2f7f17` and in section 5.7 of the act\nenvironment note. In your E4-C commit, which edits that note,\nchange the sentence of section 5.7 to \"until step E3 opens it for\na screen page\".","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}